{#
contacts/_list.stream.html.twig — the answer to every create, edit and delete
on the contacts page: a toast, and the list redrawn.

The replacement re-emits the frame with its id, or the second stream would
find nothing to replace — the rule calendar/_lists.stream.html.twig spells out.

Variables:
  cards         ContactCard[]
  query         string
  pageLimit     int
  toastMessage  translation key
#}
{% include '_partials/_toast.stream.html.twig' with { message: toastMessage|trans, type: 'success' } only %}

<turbo-stream action="replace" target="contacts-list">
    <template>
        <turbo-frame id="contacts-list">
            {% include 'contacts/_list.html.twig' with { cards: cards, query: query, pageLimit: pageLimit } only %}
        </turbo-frame>
    </template>
</turbo-stream>
